      en: "Deacon: Pray that God may have mercy on us, hear us, help us, accept the supplications and prayers of His saints on our behalf at all times, bless the bridegroom (...) and the bride (...), preserve the life and standing of our honored father, Papa Abba (…) and his partner in the liturgy, our father the bishop, Abba (…), and forgive us our sins.",
